<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I'll give you <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>> to spank me," you stammer. You hold out the money while looking at the corner of <<his>> desk. "Please."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You count out <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>> and place it neatly before Bailey. "I would like a proper spanking. Will this secure your time?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You hold the payment out in both hands. "I'll pay <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>>. Please punish me properly."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You set <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>> on the desk. "Spank me properly. That's your payment."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
