<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You slap <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>> onto the desk. "Try to make me regret paying you."
<<else>>
	"I'll pay you <<printprice $bailey_spank_price>> to spank me properly," you say. You hold out the money for <<him>> to take. "Do we have a deal?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks at you with an expression that sits between disgust and interest.
<br><br>

<<He>> takes your money and counts it before pocketing it in <<his>> jacket.<<money `-$bailey_spank_price` "baileySpank">>
